cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use rote in your work, please cite it as below."
title: rote
abstract: >-
  An open source CLI that compiles a proven AI agent skill (an
  Anthropic-style SKILL.md plus references) into a typed, deterministic
  pipeline. Fixed logic and tool orchestration move into reviewable
  code, and a model is called only for the steps that genuinely require
  judgment. Emits runnable code for DBOS, Temporal, Cloudflare
  Workflows, plain Python, DBOS TypeScript, and Inngest.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hudson
    given-names: Trevor
repository-code: "https://github.com/trevhud/rote"
url: "https://roteskills.com"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.14.0.dev0
keywords:
  - agent-skills
  - claude-skills
  - deterministic
  - workflow-compilation
  - durable-execution
  - token-cost
